Third-party components

The axiom library itself is STL-only and vendors no third-party source.
Two optional components are resolved at build time and are neither
copied into this repository nor distributed with it:

  GoogleTest  (BSD-3-Clause)  test-only; fetched by CMake
  pybind11    (BSD-3-Clause)  bindings-only; found via -Dpybind11_DIR,
                              gated behind -DAXIOM_BUILD_PYTHON=ON

Their license terms apply to those components in their own right.
